{"agent":"exp3-roadmap-bugs","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The stated intent for BUGS lists the supported filters as `--status/--since/--limit/--item`, and the acceptance criterion (\"filters cut an unfiltered 251-bug document … to the requested slice\") depends on the item filter. This kind declares `filters=frozenset({\"since\", \"limit\", \"status\", \"phase\"})` and `_data` reads only `f.phase` (line building `scope = {f.phase} | {t.id for t in q.tasks_under(f.phase)}`); it never consults `f.item`. Consequently, given `--item <id>`, the export either refuses the flag (exit 3, since \"item\" is not in the declared filter set) or, if the framework accepts it globally, silently ignores it and returns the full 251-bug document instead of the bugs raised against `<id>` — both contradict the specified behaviour, and neither produces the requested slice the acceptance test checks for.","digest":"8eaf0bef5259addb","location":"ddflow/services/export/kind_bugs.py — `_data` / `registry.register(filters=...)`","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/export/kind_bugs.py — `_data` / `registry.register(filters=...)`"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"A phase whose non-abandoned task list is empty is always emitted in the `later` lane, and is never counted as `done`. Trace: `tasks = [t for t in q.tasks_under(p.id) if t.state != ABANDONED]` can be `[]` (phase with no tasks yet, or a phase whose only tasks were all abandoned — the ABANDONED filter exists precisely because such tasks occur). Then `if tasks and n_done == len(tasks)` is false (because of the `tasks and` guard), `rows = []`, all three `any(...)` tests are false, and `lane` falls through to `\"later\"`. The phase is then appended with `\"tasks\": []` and `\"waits_on\": waits_on(q.state, p) if not rows else []` (which is `[]` whenever the phase has no unmet inherited dep). The result is a Later-lane entry whose own `waits_on` is empty and whose task list is empty, i.e. it is rendered under the \"Later — waiting on something\" blurb while nothing is waiting. This also contradicts the module docstring, under which a taskless phase vacuously has \"all its tasks done\" and belongs in the `done_phases` count; instead it is neither counted as done nor omitted, it is mislabelled as blocked. Expected for a phase with zero non-abandoned tasks: count it as Done (0/0, vacuous) or exclude it, not place it in Later.","digest":"1bfdbd9717e0922d","location":"ddflow/services/export/kind_roadmap.py `_data` (lane selection block)","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/export/kind_roadmap.py `_data` (lane selection block)"}],"chunks_total":5,"coverage":"5/5 chunk(s) reviewed","diff_chars":27930,"diff_sha":"4c0dbbfaa4581a28b1277870fc3d0d58efc252af09bffdd8ff4d19363bab6755","diff_source":"main..HEAD + working tree in /home/delian/src/.ddflow-worktrees/B-export-docs-bugs-roadmap-status","elapsed_s":722.0,"family":"deepseek","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","reason":"","reviewed":[1,2,3,4,5],"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewer_digest":"d34b8af1b4a590b5","status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/services/export/kind_bugs.py — `_data` / `registry.register(filters=...)`","ddflow/services/export/kind_roadmap.py `_data` (lane selection block)"],"unreviewed":[]},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"eb85e2c15b1bcfc2e29c4809b","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":10212,"schema":1,"subject":"B-export-docs-bugs-roadmap-status","ts":"2026-10-02T14:22:27.301629Z"}
